{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IzuSharp/Korda/pulls/37","id":5469655011,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVrfTDM8AAAABRgRP4w","html_url":"https://github.com/IzuSharp/Korda/pull/37","diff_url":"https://github.com/IzuSharp/Korda/pull/37.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/IzuSharp/Korda/pull/37.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IzuSharp/Korda/issues/37","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IzuSharp/Korda/pulls/37/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IzuSharp/Korda/pulls/37/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IzuSharp/Korda/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IzuSharp/Korda/issues/37/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IzuSharp/Korda/statuses/17da07e391ba867bbf195baa2e9fdc0bdc0cc0aa","number":37,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"DB-Exec-02: refactor database execution from Fluent to native providers","user":{"login":"deku2026","id":263133346,"node_id":"U_kgDOD68Yog","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/263133346?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deku2026","html_url":"https://github.com/deku2026","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deku2026/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deku2026/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deku2026/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deku2026/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deku2026/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deku2026/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deku2026/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deku2026/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deku2026/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## 当前候选：从 Fluent 到原生执行的完整路径\n\n公开候选 [cb233a7a60dc9e9ef2110811d78db11b1c009438](https://github.com/IzuSharp/Korda/commit/cb233a7a60dc9e9ef2110811d78db11b1c009438)，tree `0ea8d431f2d322dc9278e516da99d084413add7f`，与本地整合 `ea3a668` 完全相同。\n\n此 PR 保留公开 C# Fluent、Native AOT、C++ 执行层及两个独立 provider 包，重构命令编译、libpq/sqlite3 执行、直接批次读取、私有 pull/completion 所有权及固定主键 Find。设计依据是实际锁定的 Dapper.AOT 生成代码、Npgsql/libpq、Microsoft.Data.Sqlite/sqlite3 和现有契约。\n\n### 当前入口与取舍\n\n- 普通 Fluent 保留有界 NWQC 语义输入，C++ 是权威编译器。去掉 render 后再次编码/解析及冗余 QueryData/批次中间复制；不声称语义记录遍历已经消失。\n- 直接原生批次 arena、受 generation 保护的借用切片及生成 DTO 读取器；私有 cursor pull 与独立最终关闭保留取消、提前停止和通知尾部安全。\n- 独立 command completion（bit 28）覆盖 Count/Any、非返回 mutation、事务/保存点和正常子对象关闭；Source/Admin/不确定接纳的冷清理保留必要的 generic 路径。Count/Any 不再经行批次往返。\n- 新增私有 Find shape（bit 29 / 一个冷工厂导出）。Source 有界缓存以准确 Table 身份区分映射器；参数私有且每次键值先快照。热调用复用编译形状，跳过通用 ShapeCache 的重复哈希/LRU，继续走已有 typed pull 和精确 Table.Row 映射。删除旧的每调用 Fluent 重建，旧写法仅作为测试 oracle。\n- PostgreSQL 在同一物理连接健康、无活动 statement、非 pipeline、精确 INTRANS 且无 savepoint 时省去 pre-COMMIT SELECT 1。INERROR/25P02、savepoint、未知状态、提交后及归还证明仍保留。真实协议测试区分 libpq send 调用、Sync 和 ReadyForQuery，不把 send 调用等同网络 RTT。\n- SQLite 保持 prepare/bind 时不 step，释放仍 finalize。尚无证据支持删除的等待、复制或所有权检查均明确保留；框架 0 B 仍是目标。\n\n### 当前正确性证据\n\n- 最终 Find 原生 query：1017 检查 / 52 SQL 与有序参数 golden；两条实际 C ABI 验证通过，冻结 42 签名及私有增量闭包通过。\n- 最终 Find Release Native AOT：1152 次实际断言 / 118 次实际 managed retirement；SQLite、PostgreSQL 各 192 条 Find 断言，八项原生所有者计数全部归零。总断言数包含每次 retirement 的动态检查，不作为固定案例数。\n- Find 包含预算与错误先后顺序的旧公开入口 oracle、复合键/可变字节快照、Money codec、映射器身份、两会话、缓存条目/字节淘汰、Source 生命周期、DDL 和取消边界。失败尝试及修正保留。\n- 合并 PostgreSQL 改动后的有限集成测试：事务 13 个保留家族 / 120 检查；真实 PostgreSQL protocol 432 检查通过。\n- 之前完成通道、查询、流式、Host、取消及公开消费证据继续保留。当前候选正在从两个全新独立 worktree 打包并执行公开包 Native AOT 消费验证。\n- 实际 impact：interop、Linux 正确性、PostgreSQL 与 SQLite 各自独立包检查。无性能 workflow/job/按钮/定时任务，`ci.yml` 未改变。\n\n### 性能与交付状态\n\n历史短测已按真实提交单独归档，不归给当前 Find 候选。当前候选会重新执行同 SQL/参数/结果的普通测量、独立 FFI/分配诊断、混合负载校准及优化前补测。四段串行 30 分钟最终测量目前仍为 **0/4**；不据历史 15 秒事务结果宣称完整性能收益。\n\n设计：[Korda-Design #20](https://github.com/IzuSharp/Korda-Design/pull/20)。计划、失败记录与可复用工具：[Plan #34](https://github.com/IzuSharp/Plan/pull/34)，`execution-refactor/continuation-7/`。全部验证与审查完成后按现有 CI/发包规则正常合并。\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-24T09:37:28Z","updated_at":"2026-11-26T07:03:06Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"177eb3dd9fdce5da405b72dfdb7b0b01dc258447","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"IzuSharp:task/DB-Perf-01-linux","ref":"task/DB-Perf-01-linux","repo":{"id":1454887692,"node_id":"R_kgDOVrfTDA","name":"Korda","full_name":"IzuSharp/Korda","owner":{"login":"IzuSharp","id":355200215,"node_id":"O_kgDOFSvs1w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/355200215?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzuSharp","html_url":"https://github.com/IzuSharp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzuSharp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzuSharp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzuSharp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzuSharp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzuSharp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzuSharp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzuSharp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzuSharp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IzuSharp/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":false,"fork":false,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"description":"An AOT-first C# ecosystem bringing proven cross-language engines, compilers, and frameworks into .NET through idiomatic, strongly typed NuGet packages.","homepage":"","language":"C#","visibility":"public","is_template":false,"topics":["aot","bindings","code-generation","cross-platform","csharp","dotnet","ffi","high-performance","interop","memory-management","nuget","performance","pinvoke","source-generator","sy